OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786886309
OL,3,CGP jailed for sexually assaulting
OL,4,Cwomen during examinations after road
OL,5,Caccidents
OL,7,FA GP who sexually assaulted two women
OL,8,Fduring examinations after they had
OL,9,Fbeen in road traffic collisions has
OL,10,Fbeen jailed, police have said.
OL,12,FMuhammad Iqbal, 64, of Julianstown,
OL,13,FCounty Meath, Ireland, was charged in
OL,14,Frelation to separate incidents in
OL,15,FDarlington and Sunderland in 2023.
OL,17,FHis victims were attending
OL,18,Fphysiotherapy sessions arranged by
OL,19,Ftheir insurers following road
OL,20,Faccidents and were seen by Iqbal.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/4
