PN,39402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786886309
OL,3,CGP jailed for sexually assaulting
OL,4,Cwomen during examinations after road
OL,5,Caccidents
OL,7,FIn the first incident he grabbed the
OL,8,Fwoman's breast, while in the second he
OL,9,Fpretended he needed to examine her
OL,10,Fbreast, saying he was checking for
OL,11,Flumps, although that was not the
OL,12,Freason for the examination.
OL,14,FDurham Constabulary said Iqbal was
OL,15,Fjailed for 18 months at Newcastle
OL,16,FCrown Court on Friday and was placed
OL,17,Fon the sex offender register for 10
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
