FL,395,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786886309
OL,3,CGP jailed for sexually assaulting
OL,4,Cwomen during examinations after road
OL,5,Caccidents
OL,7,FHe had denied the offences but was
OL,8,Fconvicted following a trial, the force
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FOutside court, Detective Constable
OL,12,FCharlotte Naisby, of Durham
OL,13,FConstabulary's Complex Safeguarding
OL,14,FTeam, said: "Iqbal preyed on these
OL,15,Fwomen during a very vulnerable period
OL,16,Fin their lives and his behaviour was
OL,17,Fdespicable.
OL,26,@vD@MOU
