OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,395,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786886309
OL,3,CGP jailed for sexually assaulting
OL,4,Cwomen during examinations after road
OL,5,Caccidents
OL,7,F"The women should have felt safe being
OL,8,Fexamined by a certified GP but instead
OL,9,FIqbal not only assaulted them but
OL,10,Fbreached their trust in the most
OL,11,Fhorrendous way and we are glad to see
OL,12,Fhe is now behind bars."
OL,14,FSergeant Kimberley Ball, of
OL,15,FNorthumbria Police, praised the women
OL,16,Ffor speaking out, saying: "I am
OL,17,Fconfident they have made the North
OL,18,FEast safer now that this man's crimes
OL,19,Fhave been brought to light."
